evidence_notes = "A3 supports the Titan-class Medium Transport name and medium-transport role only. B3 and B4 corroborate labels only, not a Titan model; neither visible hull is borrowed. Historical model, scale, interior, access, systems and handling remain UNKNOWN. This owner-approved candidate is an original modern chamfered shuttle design: all geometry, dimensions, materials, pilot position, engine layout and handling/mechanics are modern choices, not historical measurements or authenticated reconstruction. Standalone hull/pilot fixture only; cabin access, passengers, cargo, combat, berth and production fleet integration remain pending. Upload dates date neither recordings nor builds."
compatibility_tags = PackedStringArray("medium_craft", "medium_transport", "multi_crew", "cargo", "titan_transport")
